# Single source of truth for the multi-monitor build inputs.
# Consumed by Dockerfile.multimonitor (as --build-arg) and the CI workflows.
#
# These two PRs are UNMERGED DRAFTS and get force-pushed — the SHAs below can
# go stale at any time. Advance them via .github/workflows/bump-shas.yml (or by
# editing this file), which re-runs the build + smoke gate before publishing.
