# Verified 2026-05-30:
#   server PR #560 (apache/guacamole-server): GUACAMOLE-288 multi-monitor
#   client PR #1061 (apache/guacamole-client): GUACAMOLE-288 multi-monitor RDP
#   Both authored by corentin-soriano, both 1.6.0-based (pom/version 1.6.0).

